{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>Upon the waters</b> Four times in the Masorah: this one, and the others: ויחנו שם על המים; בדם הצפור השחטה על המים החיים; והשמש זרחה על המים. And they saw etc. the waters red as blood. This is what the Sages said: one must put water so that the blood be visible in the water, and this is 'and they saw etc. the waters red as blood' — that the redness of the blood be visible in the water, and likewise in the plague of the river the blood was visible in the water. And in the merit of the commandment performed with water, they found twelve springs of water."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:12:10.320293306Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}